<title>POLAND: Budimex signs $15.2 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex signs $15.2 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish builder Budimex SA has signed a $15.2 million contract with the International Christian Charity Fund to construct an apartment building in the Russian town of Khotkovo, near Moscow, the firm said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement on Thursday that the construction would last 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
